sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant App
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>Browser: Submit credentials
    Browser->>App: Login request
    App->>Auth: Authenticate
    Auth-->>App: Session tokens
    App-->>Browser: Cookies
    Browser->>App: Protected route request
    App->>Auth: Validate session
    Auth-->>App: Identity
    App->>DB: Query scoped data
    DB-->>App: Authorized rows
    App-->>Browser: Protected response